###Azure (Microsoft Foundry) and Copilot Studio agents are native. Connected platforms documented for registry sync/observability: Amazon Bedrock (Agents Classic and AgentCore), Google Vertex AI, Anthropic Claude Managed Agents and Oracle Generative AI Agents (preview). Other agents can be onboarded with the Agent 365 SDK, and Microsoft lists ecosystem partner agents available in Agent 365.
Gaps / caveats: No native connector was found for ServiceNow, SAP, Salesforce or Databricks; Microsoft's documentation mentions Salesforce and Databricks only as places agents run. Those platforms would rely on vendor adoption of the Agent 365 SDK - confirm per vendor with Microsoft. External/SaaS agents not onboarded via the SDK cannot be governed at the agent-identity level. Registry sync is preview.
