###Two layers. (a) Agent 365 shadow AI discovery uses Defender + Intune to surface unregistered local agents and MCP servers on managed devices and lists them for review (register, remediate or decommission). (b) Unapproved AI vendors/SaaS are identified by Defender for Cloud Apps Cloud Discovery (Generative AI category, app risk scores) and Entra Global Secure Access at the network layer.
Gaps / caveats: Relies on additional Microsoft security licensing (Defender for Endpoint/Cloud Apps, Intune, Global Secure Access) and only sees managed devices / routed traffic. Shadow AI discovery is preview. Coverage of unmanaged/BYOD devices needs investigation.
