###Agent 365 observability (OpenTelemetry) records spans for agent invocation, each LLM inference call and each tool call. Copilot Studio agents emit this automatically; custom agents use the Microsoft OpenTelemetry Distro/Agent 365 SDK. Telemetry surfaces in Defender (CloudAppEvents advanced hunting), Purview and the M365 admin center. Third-party observability for Bedrock, Vertex AI and Claude Managed Agents is documented as Frontier/in development.
Gaps / caveats: Only instrumented or connected agents are visible; calls made by non-instrumented agents to external APIs/models are not captured. Requires Purview auditing to be enabled. Third-party observability is still in development.
