###Purview: a DLP policy scoped to the Microsoft 365 Copilot location can stop Copilot Studio agents from processing content with specified sensitivity labels (SharePoint knowledge source); agent responses show the highest-priority label of the data used, and new Word/PowerPoint content inherits it. Purview data security and compliance for Agent 365 is documented. Entra Conditional Access applies to agent identities and agent users (agent risk as a condition; a Microsoft-managed policy blocks high-risk agents).
Gaps / caveats: DLP blocking of sensitive prompts typed directly into Copilot/agents was not confirmed - needs verification. Label/encryption support is limited to specific knowledge sources. Data Security Posture Management (classic) does not support Agent 365. Third-party agents are only covered where they integrate with Purview.
